\title Japanese sentence
\about A constructed Japanese sentence, with furigana and transcriptions.

\igt
\text {青|あお}{空|ぞら} に {白|しろ}い {雲|くも} が {浮|う}かぶ。
  \morph 青空 に 白-い 雲 が 浮かぶ
\text[phonemic] aozora ni siroi kumo ga ukabu
\text[phonetic] aozoɾa ni ɕiɾoi kɯmo ga ɯkabɯ
\glmorph blue.sky in white-ADJ cloud NOM float
\ft White clouds float in the blue sky.
\note[kumo] {雲} *kumo*: cloud.
